sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    
    participant Client as Client
    participant CDN as CDN
    participant LB as Load Balancer
    participant API as API Server
    participant Cache as Redis Cache
    participant KGS as Key Gen Service
    participant DB as Database
    participant Queue as Kafka
    
    Note over Client,Queue: URL Creation Flow
    
    Client->>LB: POST /api/v1/urls<br/>{longUrl: "https://..."}
    LB->>API: Forward request
    
    API->>API: Validate URL format
    
    alt Invalid URL
        API-->>Client: 400 Bad Request
    end
    
    alt Custom alias requested
        API->>DB: Check if alias exists
        DB-->>API: Result
        alt Alias exists
            API-->>Client: 409 Conflict
        end
    else Auto-generate code
        API->>KGS: Request short code
        KGS->>KGS: Get code from pool
        KGS-->>API: "abc1234"
    end
    
    API->>DB: INSERT urls (short_code, long_url, ...)
    DB-->>API: Success
    
    API->>Cache: SET abc1234 "https://..." EX 86400
    Cache-->>API: OK
    
    API-->>LB: 201 Created
    LB-->>Client: {shortUrl: "short.ly/abc1234"}
    
    Note over Client,Queue: URL Redirect Flow
    
    Client->>CDN: GET /abc1234
    
    alt CDN Cache Hit
        CDN-->>Client: 301 Redirect to long_url
    else CDN Cache Miss
        CDN->>LB: Forward request
        LB->>API: GET /abc1234
        
        API->>Cache: GET abc1234
        
        alt Cache Hit
            Cache-->>API: "https://long-url.com/..."
        else Cache Miss
            API->>DB: SELECT * FROM urls WHERE short_code = 'abc1234'
            DB-->>API: URL record
            
            alt URL not found
                API-->>Client: 404 Not Found
            else URL expired
                API-->>Client: 410 Gone
            else URL found
                API->>Cache: SET abc1234 "..." EX 86400
                Cache-->>API: OK
            end
        end
        
        API->>Queue: Emit click event (async)
        Note right of Queue: Non-blocking
        
        API-->>LB: 301 Redirect
        LB-->>CDN: 301 Redirect
        CDN->>CDN: Cache response
        CDN-->>Client: 301 Redirect to long_url
    end
    
    Client->>Client: Browser follows redirect
    
    Note over Client,Queue: Analytics Aggregation (Background)
    
    Queue->>Queue: Batch click events
    Queue->>DB: UPDATE click_count
